        "rationale": "All three abort paths are fixed with guards scoped to the command expected to fail: `if grep -q` in assert_line, `elif delta=$(cmp ...)` in assert_golden, and `if ! actual=$(...)` in assert_slug (plus the golden-file slugify run), so each failure becomes one FAIL, the run continues and still exits non-zero, which the agent checked with three deliberate breaks, without disabling set -e globally."
